     "lineFrom": 259,
     "lineTo": 264,
     "text": "[Certain] In orbit, gravity-gradient torque exchanges angular momentum with the spin periodically (fractional tip-speed modulation of order 1.5*n^2/omega^2 ~ 3% at Rev A geometry), so INSTANTANEOUS tip speed oscillates about the analytic EQ-3 value. The rotation-average is the quantity that matches v_tip and v_tip^2/L; averaging over an integer number of rotations cancels the periodic exchange."
